WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.400
SCP-096 Vs SCP-076.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.520
The mass-murdering, indestructible Shy Guy
vs the master swordsman who just keeps on

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.720
coming, Able.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:11.680
Who would win?

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.480
Able is undeniably an incredible combatant.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:18.640
He’s perhaps the most deadly force on earth
with an edged weapon, and he can produce these

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.160
weapons out of thin air.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.680
However, when someone sees 096’s face, almost
nothing can stop it from killing its target.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.880
Able may be a master swordsman, but deadlier,
more advanced weapons have still failed to

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.440
stop 096’s rampages.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.200
On the upside, though, Able would be back
and killing people again soon enough when

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.080
he regenerates in his coffin.
Wait, that’s not an upside...

